    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a simple melee or thrown weapon with the finesse or agile traits. </p><hr><p>Unassuming weaponry becomes deadly in your hands with the right application. You Strike with the required weapon. If you have no multi-attack penalty the weapon gains the Fatal d8 trait, or Fatal d10 trait if it already has the Fatal d8 trait. If you already have multi-attack penalty, your multiple attack penalty is -3 (-2 with an agile attack) on your second attack of the turn instead of -5, and -6 (-4 with an agile attack) on your third or subsequent attack of the turn, instead of -10. Special You can substitute Strikes made as part of the Fortune’s Sword spell with Keen Dealer strikes.<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
